From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:16:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: mt6797: bind the Gemini speaker amplifiers to the card

The Gemini audio routes name the two AW8736 amplifiers, but nothing adds
them to the card. Their components never join it, so their widgets do not
exist, snd_soc_dapm_add_routes() returns -ENODEV for "Speaker Amp L IN"
and the card fails to bind, taking headphones and microphones with it.

Parse an audio-aux-devs property, as other ASoC cards do, and list both
amplifiers in the Gemini card.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mt6797-mt6351.txt | 1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts        | 2 ++
 sound/soc/mediatek/mt6797/mt6797-mt6351.c                 | 6 ++++++
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mt6797-mt6351.txt b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mt6797-mt6351.txt
index 5444420..4e79c1a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mt6797-mt6351.txt
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mt6797-mt6351.txt
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ Required properties:
 - mediatek,platform: the phandle of MT6797 ASoC platform
 - mediatek,audio-codec: the phandles of MT6351 codec
 - audio-routing: optional card-level DAPM routes
+- audio-aux-devs: optional phandles of amplifiers named in audio-routing
 
 Example:
 
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts
index 3d2e9ef..668f29b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda.dts
@@ -55,6 +55,8 @@
 			"AIN0", "Main Mic",
 			"AIN1", "Headset Mic",
 			"AIN2", "Back Mic";
+
+		audio-aux-devs = <&speaker_amp_left>, <&speaker_amp_right>;
 	};
 
 	chosen {
diff --git a/sound/soc/mediatek/mt6797/mt6797-mt6351.c b/sound/soc/mediatek/mt6797/mt6797-mt6351.c
index db3b325..a904398 100644
--- a/sound/soc/mediatek/mt6797/mt6797-mt6351.c
+++ b/sound/soc/mediatek/mt6797/mt6797-mt6351.c
@@ -242,6 +242,12 @@ static int mt6797_mt6351_dev_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 		goto put_codec_node;
 	}
 
+	ret = snd_soc_of_parse_aux_devs(card, "audio-aux-devs");
+	if (ret) {
+		dev_err(&pdev->dev, "failed to parse audio-aux-devs: %d\n", ret);
+		goto put_codec_node;
+	}
+
 	ret = devm_snd_soc_register_card(&pdev->dev, card);
 	if (ret)
 		dev_err(&pdev->dev, "%s snd_soc_register_card fail %d\n",
